<title>GREECE: FORECAST - Greek Feb inflation seen at 6.5pct yr/y.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Greek Feb inflation seen at 6.5pct yr/y.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek consumer price inflation will fall to 6.5 percent year-on-year in February from 6.8 percent in January, bankers and economists predicted in a poll conducted by Reuters.</p>
<p>Fifteen bankers and economists participated in the informal poll that produced a mean forecast of 6.5 percent, the same as the median. Forecasts ranged from 6.6 percent to 6.4 percent.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
